From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 08:13:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] themes: Stevia's look for the keys, an accent color from the
 configuration

The password prompt shows the on-screen keyboard the user chose for the
session. Phosh's keyboard Stevia has two looks, so unl0kr gets both:

- New theme plinius-original: Stevia's dark keys with the colors measured
  on screen, bold letters and the confirm key in the accent color
- plinius-glass gets the sizes of Stevia's glass look on the Volla; an
  active modifier looks like a pressed key, as there
- The keys of both themes use Adwaita Sans at 44 px like Stevia, as two
  small fonts with the characters on the keys. bbx_font_32 stays the font
  of all other text and the fallback for pictograms.
- New option [theme] accent=#rrggbb for the two Plinius themes
- keyboard.portrait_height_permille: height from the width of the display,
  so the keys keep Stevia's shape instead of growing with the screen
---
 man/unl0kr.conf.5.scd            |     7 +-
 meson.build                      |     2 +
 shared/fonts/AdwaitaSans-LICENSE |    96 +
 shared/fonts/README.md           |     5 +
 shared/fonts/font_key_bold.c     | 11769 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 shared/fonts/font_key_regular.c  | 10822 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 shared/fonts/regenerate-keys.sh  |    23 +
 shared/theme.c                   |    62 +-
 shared/theme.h                   |    20 +
 shared/themes.c                  |   221 +-
 shared/themes.h                  |    10 +
 unl0kr/config.c                  |    11 +
 unl0kr/config.h                  |     3 +
 unl0kr/main.c                    |     8 +-
 14 files changed, 23042 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 shared/fonts/AdwaitaSans-LICENSE
 create mode 100644 shared/fonts/font_key_bold.c
 create mode 100644 shared/fonts/font_key_regular.c
 create mode 100755 shared/fonts/regenerate-keys.sh

diff --git a/man/unl0kr.conf.5.scd b/man/unl0kr.conf.5.scd
index 2d2e962..2ec3a03 100644
--- a/man/unl0kr.conf.5.scd
+++ b/man/unl0kr.conf.5.scd
@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@ for and, if found, merged in the following order:
 	The character that will be used to obscure the password. Default: • (U+2022).
 
 ## Theme
-*default* = <adwaita-light|adwaita-dark|breezy-light|breezy-dark|nord-light|nord-dark|pmos-light|pmos-dark|plinius-glass>
+*default* = <adwaita-light|adwaita-dark|breezy-light|breezy-dark|nord-light|nord-dark|pmos-light|pmos-dark|plinius-glass|plinius-original>
 	Selects the default theme on boot. Can be changed at runtime to the 
 	alternative theme. Default: breezy-light.
 
@@ -77,6 +77,11 @@ for and, if found, merged in the following order:
 	A small, blurred image is enough, it is scaled up once at start. Themes
 	with translucent surfaces (plinius-glass) need it. Default: none.
 
+*accent* = <#rrggbb>
+	Accent color of the themes plinius-glass and plinius-original: the color of
+	the confirm or pressed keys, of the selection and of the progress bar. Other
+	themes ignore it. Default: the theme's own color.
+
 ## Input
 *keyboard* = <true|false>
 	Enable or disable the use of hardware keyboards. Default: true.
