+Plinius: fonts of the on-screen keys
+------------------------------------
+
+`font_key_regular.c` and `font_key_bold.c` hold Adwaita Sans at 44 px, the font and size of the labels of Phosh's keyboard Stevia. They contain only the characters on the keys and fall back to `bbx_font_32` for pictograms. `regenerate-keys.sh` makes them from static weights of the variable font. Adwaita Sans is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, see `AdwaitaSans-LICENSE`.
